     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet at-ips-immunization-vacine-codes</b></p><a name=\"at-ips-immunization-vacine-codes\"> </a><a name=\"hcat-ips-immunization-vacine-codes\"> </a><a name=\"at-ips-immunization-vacine-codes-de-AT\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a> where concept  is-a 787482006 (No known immunizations)</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a> where concept  is-a 787859002 (Vaccine product)</li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in https://termgit.elga.gv.at/ValueSet/eimpf-immunizationtarget</li></ul></div>"
